      "size": 34,
      "distinct_size": 34,
      "ref": "refs/heads/openwrt-24.10",
      "head": "11275bec82a33de336e57a52d068f71859c8468c",
      "before": "d55754ce0dc513e3b4167876a76414f932c52f28",
      "commits": [
        {
          "sha": "1e530e5831f3a0e10576d106236f1fa6f48c39e4",
          "author": {
            "email": "hauke@hauke-m.de",
            "name": "Hauke Mehrtens"
          },
          "message": "OpenWrt v24.10.0-rc4: adjust config defaults\n\nSigned-off-by: Hauke Mehrtens <hauke@hauke-m.de>",
          "distinct": true,
          "url": "https://api.github.com/repos/stklcode/openwrt/commits/1e530e5831f3a0e10576d106236f1fa6f48c39e4"
        },
        {
          "sha": "372afe10f098692b2d21641878e86191160ec2ed",
          "author": {
            "email": "hauke@hauke-m.de",
            "name": "Hauke Mehrtens"
          },
          "message": "OpenWrt v24.10.0-rc4: revert to branch defaults\n\nSigned-off-by: Hauke Mehrtens <hauke@hauke-m.de>",
          "distinct": true,
          "url": "https://api.github.com/repos/stklcode/openwrt/commits/372afe10f098692b2d21641878e86191160ec2ed"
        },
        {
          "sha": "08f1bde12b3cba2daee556efcf91863e962dce38",
          "author": {
            "email": "f.maurer@outlook.de",
            "name": "Florian Maurer"
          },
          "message": "ipq40xx-generic: EN WS-AP3915i remove BLOCKSIZE from image definition\n\nThe blocksize was too high, resulting in forgetting the config on sysupgrade\nIt is not needed for SPI-NOR.\n\nSigned-off-by: Florian Maurer <f.maurer@outlook.de>\nLink: https://github.com/openwrt/openwrt/pull/17305\nSigned-off-by: Robert Marko <robimarko@gmail.com>\n(cherry picked from commit 24fc5ff2136a10bf0ee9e764ae0404b2928a67ce)",
          "distinct": true,
          "url": "https://api.github.com/repos/stklcode/openwrt/commits/08f1bde12b3cba2daee556efcf91863e962dce38"
        },
        {
          "sha": "f7398101db7a2ddbd037658c74311fad79f9cda3",
          "author": {
            "email": "f.maurer@outlook.de",
            "name": "Florian Maurer"
          },
          "message": "ipq40xx-generic: ws-ap3915i fix macadress\n\nset macaddress correctly for board\n\nSigned-off-by: Florian Maurer <f.maurer@outlook.de>\nLink: https://github.com/openwrt/openwrt/pull/17305\nSigned-off-by: Robert Marko <robimarko@gmail.com>\n(cherry picked from commit 363f52d067e1852d46ccdc3ab4d12bc2f9d018dd)",
          "distinct": true,
          "url": "https://api.github.com/repos/stklcode/openwrt/commits/f7398101db7a2ddbd037658c74311fad79f9cda3"
        },
        {
          "sha": "d036b42dd96bc7630a9c8db2dc82704b36b020de",
          "author": {
            "email": "cnsztl@immortalwrt.org",
            "name": "Tianling Shen"
          },
          "message": "uboot-rockchip: fix build with swig 4.3.0\n\nFixes the following error by backporting upstream update:\n```\nscripts/dtc/pylibfdt/libfdt_wrap.c: In function ‘_wrap_fdt_next_node’:\nscripts/dtc/pylibfdt/libfdt_wrap.c:5581:17: error: too few arguments to function ‘SWIG_Python_AppendOutput’\n 5581 |     resultobj = SWIG_Python_AppendOutput(resultobj, val);\n      |                 ^~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~\n```\n\nFixes: https://github.com/openwrt/openwrt/issues/17345\nSigned-off-by: Tianling Shen <cnsztl@immortalwrt.org>\nLink: https://github.com/openwrt/openwrt/pull/17352\nSigned-off-by: Hauke Mehrtens <hauke@hauke-m.de>\n(cherry picked from commit 4e68103c4eb93d3f9b9359742c3c377ee2844943)",
          "distinct": true,
