        "active_lock_reason": null,
        "body": "### Aircraft Version\n\nDevelopment\n\n### Build info\n\n```json\n{\r\n    \"built\": \"2025-01-01T10:40:42+00:00\",\r\n    \"ref\": \"refs/heads/master\",\r\n    \"sha\": \"a0c9ddd95133343f7b5413a834fe207ba747691c\",\r\n    \"actor\": \"tracernz\",\r\n    \"event_name\": \"manual\",\r\n    \"pretty_release_name\": \"master:a0c9ddd9\",\r\n    \"version\": \"a32nx-v0.13.0-dev.a0c9ddd\"\r\n}\n```\n\n\n### Describe the bug\n\nGS* engaged really early when GS diamond was still on top of the scale.\r\n\r\nPlane FMA went to ALT LOC when I disconnected the AP. Lateral FD bar began to blink.\r\n\r\nWhen showing LAND, GS and LAND overlapped for a second.\r\n\r\n(video attached)\n\n### Expected behavior\n\nGS* engages when GS diamond approaches the middle of the scale.\r\n\r\nPlane doesn't change FMA and remains in GS and LOC for the landing, FD bar doesn't blink.\r\n\r\nGS and LAND don't overlap.\n\n### Steps to reproduce\n\n1. Load up the plane and fly to ENGM.\r\n\r\n2. Fly the ILS 01R\n\n### References (optional)\n\nhttps://www.youtube.com/watch?v=AYAou7qiVUE\n\n### Additional info (optional)\n\n_No response_\n\n### Discord Username (optional)\n\n_No response_",
