        "title": "Edm 439: Rollout policies device selection and disruption allowance implementation",
        "user": {
          "login": "ori-amizur",
          "id": 60868946,
          "node_id": "MDQ6VXNlcjYwODY4OTQ2",
          "avatar_url": "https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/60868946?v=4",
          "gravatar_id": "",
          "url": "https://api.github.com/users/ori-amizur",
          "html_url": "https://github.com/ori-amizur",
          "followers_url": "https://api.github.com/users/ori-amizur/followers",
          "following_url": "https://api.github.com/users/ori-amizur/following{/other_user}",
          "gists_url": "https://api.github.com/users/ori-amizur/gists{/gist_id}",
          "starred_url": "https://api.github.com/users/ori-amizur/starred{/owner}{/repo}",
          "subscriptions_url": "https://api.github.com/users/ori-amizur/subscriptions",
          "organizations_url": "https://api.github.com/users/ori-amizur/orgs",
          "repos_url": "https://api.github.com/users/ori-amizur/repos",
          "events_url": "https://api.github.com/users/ori-amizur/events{/privacy}",
          "received_events_url": "https://api.github.com/users/ori-amizur/received_events",
          "type": "User",
          "user_view_type": "public",
          "site_admin": false
        },
        "body": "This implements the logic for both device selection and disruption allowance.\r\nBelow is a spec for both (not full):\r\n\r\n```\r\napiVersion: v1alpha1\r\nkind: Fleet\r\nmetadata:\r\n  name: default\r\nspec:\r\n  selector:\r\n    matchLabels:\r\n      fleet: default\r\n  rolloutPolicy:\r\n    deviceSelection:\r\n      strategy: 'BatchSequence'\r\n      sequence:\r\n        - selector:\r\n            matchLabels:\r\n              site: madrid\r\n        - limit: 50%\r\n        - selector:\r\n            matchLabels:\r\n              site: paris\r\n    disruptionAllowance:\r\n      minAvailable: 1\r\n      groupBy: ['site']\r\n```\r\n\r\nThe device selection and disruption allowance logic are implemented by reconcilers that are invoked by the periodic server.\r\n\r\nFor device selection, the rollout flow by the **fleet_validate** task is disabled if device selection is defined in the spec.  Instead the reconciler is responsible to invoke the rollout when conditions are met.\r\n\r\nFor disruption allowance, the device render flow by the **fleet_rollout** task is disabled if disruption allowance is defined in the spec.  Instead the reconciler is responsible to invoke the device render when conditions are met.\r\n\r\n",
