        "body": "## What's Changed\n* deps: bump the production-dependencies group with 2 updates by @dependabot in https://github.com/42ByteLabs/konarr/pull/14\n* Feat: Snapshot Updates by @GeekMasher in https://github.com/42ByteLabs/konarr/pull/15\n* Improve Tools support by adding Grype and Trivy by @GeekMasher in https://github.com/42ByteLabs/konarr/pull/16\n* feat(frontend): Update frontend - 14 Dec by @GeekMasher in https://github.com/42ByteLabs/konarr/pull/17\n* feat(core): Update Bill of Materials to have better support by @GeekMasher in https://github.com/42ByteLabs/konarr/pull/18\n* feat(server): Update Server API to have agent settings  by @GeekMasher in https://github.com/42ByteLabs/konarr/pull/19\n* feat(core): Add background tasks support by @GeekMasher in https://github.com/42ByteLabs/konarr/pull/21\n* feat(server): Add in-memory sessions cache by @GeekMasher in https://github.com/42ByteLabs/konarr/pull/23\n* deps: bump the production-dependencies group with 4 updates by @dependabot in https://github.com/42ByteLabs/konarr/pull/22\n* feat(core): Update GrypeDB + snapshots to fix various issues by @GeekMasher in https://github.com/42ByteLabs/konarr/pull/24\n* Dynamic Agent Security Tool Support by @GeekMasher in https://github.com/42ByteLabs/konarr/pull/25\n* feat(core): Update components catalog small changes by @GeekMasher in https://github.com/42ByteLabs/konarr/pull/26\n* feat(server): Small updates to the server by @GeekMasher in https://github.com/42ByteLabs/konarr/pull/27\n* Catalogue System by @GeekMasher in https://github.com/42ByteLabs/konarr/pull/28\n* Catalogue issue update by @GeekMasher in https://github.com/42ByteLabs/konarr/pull/29\n* feat(cli): Update CLI to better support tools by @GeekMasher in https://github.com/42ByteLabs/konarr/pull/30\n* Tools, APIs, and Client by @GeekMasher in https://github.com/42ByteLabs/konarr/pull/31\n* Small api updates by @GeekMasher in https://github.com/42ByteLabs/konarr/pull/32\n* feat(tools): Update tools and cli to fix tools workflow by @GeekMasher in https://github.com/42ByteLabs/konarr/pull/33\n* Server LibSQL Updates by @GeekMasher in https://github.com/42ByteLabs/konarr/pull/34\n* deps: bump the production-dependencies group with 3 updates by @dependabot in https://github.com/42ByteLabs/konarr/pull/35\n* Models renaming and small changes by @GeekMasher in https://github.com/42ByteLabs/konarr/pull/36\n* deps: bump the production-dependencies group with 3 updates by @dependabot in https://github.com/42ByteLabs/konarr/pull/37\n* Improve SBOM Scanning by @GeekMasher in https://github.com/42ByteLabs/konarr/pull/38\n* deps: Bump reqwest from 0.12.11 to 0.12.12 in the production-dependencies group by @dependabot in https://github.com/42ByteLabs/konarr/pull/39\n* v0.3.0 by @GeekMasher in https://github.com/42ByteLabs/konarr/pull/20\n\n\n**Full Changelog**: https://github.com/42ByteLabs/konarr/compare/0.2.4...0.3.0",
