        "body": "Bumps [tailwindcss](https://github.com/tailwindlabs/tailwindcss) from 3.4.15 to 3.4.17.\n<details>\n<summary>Release notes</summary>\n<p><em>Sourced from <a href=\"https://github.com/tailwindlabs/tailwindcss/releases\">tailwindcss's releases</a>.</em></p>\n<blockquote>\n<h2>v3.4.17</h2>\n<h3>Fixed</h3>\n<ul>\n<li>Work around Node v22.12+ issue (<a href=\"https://redirect.github.com/tailwindlabs/tailwindcss/pull/15421\">#15421</a>)</li>\n</ul>\n<h2>v3.4.16</h2>\n<h3>Fixed</h3>\n<ul>\n<li>Ensure the TypeScript types for <code>PluginsConfig</code> allow <code>undefined</code> values (<a href=\"https://redirect.github.com/tailwindlabs/tailwindcss/pull/14668\">#14668</a>)</li>\n</ul>\n<h1>Changed</h1>\n<ul>\n<li>Bumped lilconfig to v3.x (<a href=\"https://redirect.github.com/tailwindlabs/tailwindcss/pull/15289\">#15289</a>)</li>\n</ul>\n</blockquote>\n</details>\n<details>\n<summary>Changelog</summary>\n<p><em>Sourced from <a href=\"https://github.com/tailwindlabs/tailwindcss/blob/v3.4.17/CHANGELOG.md\">tailwindcss's changelog</a>.</em></p>\n<blockquote>\n<h2>[3.4.17] - 2024-12-17</h2>\n<h3>Fixed</h3>\n<ul>\n<li>Work around Node v22.12+ issue (<a href=\"https://redirect.github.com/tailwindlabs/tailwindcss/pull/15421\">#15421</a>)</li>\n</ul>\n<h2>[3.4.16] - 2024-12-03</h2>\n<h3>Fixed</h3>\n<ul>\n<li>Ensure the TypeScript types for <code>PluginsConfig</code> allow <code>undefined</code> values (<a href=\"https://redirect.github.com/tailwindlabs/tailwindcss/pull/14668\">#14668</a>)</li>\n</ul>\n<h1>Changed</h1>\n<ul>\n<li>Bumped lilconfig to v3.x (<a href=\"https://redirect.github.com/tailwindlabs/tailwindcss/pull/15289\">#15289</a>)</li>\n</ul>\n</blockquote>\n</details>\n<details>\n<summary>Commits</summary>\n<ul>\n<li><a href=\"https��Ǉ KG31l-���6���hQ�L1F}ot
